Package: ModSoftBart
Type: Package
Title: Implements the SoftBart Algorithm with group handling
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: 
  person("Kaizong", "Ye", email = "kaizong.ye@nih.gov", role = c("aut", "cre"))
